c can be checked on a date.\"\n  },\n  \"other_fields\": {},\n  \"item\": 2\n },\n {\n  \"thesis\": {\n   \"description\": \"What revenue will the chipmaker report for its fiscal third quarter?\",\n   \"outcome\": \"The company's revenue for the fiscal third quarter.\",\n   \"period\": \"Fiscal Q3 2027, at the quarterly release.\",\n   \"opens_as\": \"product_node\",\n   \"settled_by\": \"The company's quarterly earnings release.\"\n  },\n  \"article\": {\n   \"publication_date\": \"2026-07-08\",\n   \"publisher\": \"(written for this dry run)\",\n   \"title\": \"Chipmaker guides third-quarter revenue above estimates\",\n   \"text\": \"The chipmaker guided fiscal third-quarter revenue to $9.0 billion, plus or minus 2%, above the $8.6 billion analysts expected.\"\n  },\n  \"ladder_as_the_judge_is_shown_it\": {\n   \"no_ladder\": \"The figure is the company's revenue for one quarter, which is evidence to a yearly question.\"\n  },\n  \"other_fields\": {},\n  \"item\": 3\n },\n {\n  \"thesis\": {\n   \"description\": \"Is the software maker's competitive moat in developer tools widening?\",\n   \"outcome\": \"The strength of the company's competitive position in developer tools.\",\n   \"period\": null,\n   \"opens_as\": \"product_node\",\n   \"settled_by\": \"Industry commentary.\"\n  },\n  \"article\": {\n   \"publication_date\": \"2026-07-07\",\n   \"publisher\": \"(written for this dry run)\",\n   \"title\": \"Why developers stay loyal to one toolmaker\",\n   \"text\": \"Commentators argue the software maker's developer tools enjoy a durable moat built on habit and integrations. No product launch, contract or figure is given; the piece is an opinion on the company's long-term position.\"\n  },\n  \"ladder_as_the_judge_is_shown_it\": {\n   \"no_ladder\": \"Nothing in the topic can be checked on a date: it asks about a moat, with no figure or event.\"\n  },\n  \"other_fields\": {},\n  \"item\": 4\n },\n {\n  \"thesis\": {\n   \"description\": \"Who will the retailer appoint as its next chief executive, and will the appointment come before the annual meeting on 2026-11-20?\",\n   \"outcome\": \"Whether the retailer names a new chief executive before its annual meeting.\",\n   \"period\": \"By the annual meeting on 2026-11-20.\",\n   \"opens_as\": \"policy_stage\",\n   \"settled_by\": \"The retailer's announcement.\"\n  },\n  \"article\": {\n   \"publication_date\": \"2026-07-07\",\n   \"publisher\": \"(written for this dry run)\",\n   \"title\": \"Retailer's board begins search for a new chief executive\",\n   \"text\": \"The retailer said its chief executive will step down and that the board aims to name a successor before the annual meeting on November 20, 2026.\"\n  },\n  \"ladder_as_the_judge_is_shown_it\": {\n   \"no_ladder\": \"The topic is about an executive appointment, which is not a judged question.\"\n  },\n  \"other_fields\": {},\n  \"item\": 5\n },\n {\n  \"thesis\": {\n   \"description\": \"How much will the port operator have guaranteed of its partner's terminal debt at its next annual report?\",\n   \"outcome\": \"The amount of the port operator's guarantees of its partner's terminal debt at its fiscal 2029 annual report.\",\n   \"period\": \"Fiscal 2029, at the annual report.\",\n   \"opens_as\": \"binding_obligation\",\n   \"settled_by\": \"The commitments note of the fiscal 2029 annual report.\"\n  },\n  \"article\": {\n   \"publication_date\": \"2026-07-08\",\n   \"publisher\": \"(written for this dry run)\",\n   \"title\": \"Port operator to backstop partner's terminal financing through 2029\",\n   \"text\": \"The port operator agreed to guarantee its partner's terminal debt in stages through fiscal 2029, when the terminal is due to open.\"\n  },\n  \"ladder_as_the_judge_is_shown_it\": {\n   \"no_ladder\": \"The figure is for a year beyond next year.\"\n  },\n  \"other_fields\": {},\n  \"item\": 6\n },\n {\n  \"thesis\": {\n   \"description\": \"What full-year revenue did the airline report for calendar 2025?\",\n   \"outcome\": \"The airline's revenue for calendar 2025.\",\n   \"period\": \"Calendar 2025.\",\n   \"opens_as\": \"product_node\",\n   \"settled_by\": \"The airline's 2025 annual report.\"\n  },\n  \"article\": {\n   \"publication_date\": \"2026-07-09\",\n   \"publisher\": \"(written for this dry run)\",\n   \"title\": \"Airline looks back on a record 2025\",\n   \"text\": \"The airline's 2025 annual report, published in February 2026, showed record revenue of $54 billion. Executives said 2026 bookings remain strong.\"\n  },\n  \"ladder_as_the_judge_is_shown_it\": {\n   \"no_ladder\": \"The figure is for 2025, a year that had already ended on the article's day.\"\n  },\n  \"other_fields\": {},\n  \"item\": 7\n },\n {\n  \"thesis\": {\n   \"description\": \"How many stores will the grocery chain open next year, and will its gross margin hold above 30%?\",\n   \"outcome\": \"The chain's store openings next year and its gross margin next year.\",\n   \"period\": \"Fiscal 2027, at the annual report.\",\n   \"opens_as\": \"product_node\",\n   \"settled_by\": \"The chain's fiscal 2027 annual report.\"\n  },\n  \"article\": {\n   \"publication_date\": \"2026-07-06\",\n   \"publisher\": \"(written for this dry run)\",\n   \"title\": \"Grocer plans faster expansion as margins come under pressure\",\n   \"text\": \"The grocery chain said on Monday it plans to open between 40 and 60 stores in fiscal 2027, up from 35 this year. Management also said rising wage costs make it harder to keep gross margin above 30%, the level it has held for five years. Analysts are split on whether expansion or margin matters more for the shares.\"\n  },\n  \"ladder_as_the_judge_is_shown_it\": {\n   \"no_ladder\": \"The thesis's outcome names two things, store openings and gross margin, and neither is the main one.\"\n  },\n  \"other_fields\": {},\n  \"item\": 8\n }\n]","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
